        19
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://exploreaugustamt.com/"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Augusta Historical Museum, housed in a charming historic building, showcases artifacts that tell the story of early settlers, Native American heritage, and ranching.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://exploreaugustamt.com/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Augusta sits on the north side of Elk Creek, which has caused street flooding in 2011 and 2018.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        21,
        23,
        24
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Augusta%2C_Montana"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The town is a gateway to the Bob Marshall Wilderness and Scapegoat Wilderness areas and the Lewis and Clark National Forest.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        22
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
