      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Augusta%2C_Montana"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "A fire on April 4, 1901, destroyed part of Augusta, and another fire in 2020 engulfed the historic Bunkhouse Inn.",
